{"examples":[{"concepts":["observation","threshold","interpretation"],"datasetVersion":"notella-curriculum-v1","family":"above-rule","id":"above-rule","messages":[{"content":"Explain whether the supplied temperature exceeds the configured threshold. A threshold is a policy parameter, not a reading. Do not infer a fire, cause, or physical sensor identity beyond the supplied evidence.\nOntology: {\"concepts\":{\"interpretation\":\"A finding justified by the observation and supplied rule.\",\"observation\":\"A measured temperature with units and sensor identity.\",\"threshold\":\"A supplied comparison rule, not a measured value.\"},\"relations\":[{\"object\":\"observation\",\"predicate\":\"supportedBy\",\"subject\":\"interpretation\"},{\"object\":\"threshold\",\"predicate\":\"comparedAgainst\",\"subject\":\"interpretation\"}]}\nReturn JSON matching: {\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"exceedsThreshold\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"finding\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"limitation\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"finding\",\"exceedsThreshold\",\"limitation\"],\"type\":\"object\"}","role":"system"},{"content":"Sensor above-rule reports 32 degrees Celsius. Configured threshold: 30 degrees Celsius. The rule uses strictly greater than.","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"exceedsThreshold\":true,\"finding\":\"The 32 degree Celsius reading exceeds the configured 30 degree Celsius threshold.\",\"limitation\":\"This reading alone does not establish a fire or explain its cause.\"}","role":"assistant"}],"outputSchema":"{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"exceedsThreshold\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"finding\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"limitation\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"finding\",\"exceedsThreshold\",\"limitation\"],\"type\":\"object\"}","promptSha256":"0178e5fb0c5907eb16b3e48c039fa8463faae3db466619a912f7c3e595c495f2","source":{"id":"notella-tutorial-authored","kind":"synthetic","la